{"id":"37a17388a10eb254","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-lem-delta-system.md","title":"Delta System Lemma","display":"lem-delta-system — Delta System Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-delta-system","aliases":["58-lem-delta-system","Delta System Lemma","Sunflower Lemma","Δ-System Lemma"],"display":"lem-delta-system — Delta System Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-delta-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-delta-system</span><span>Delta System Lemma</span><span>Sunflower Lemma</span><span>Δ-System Lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-delta-system — Delta System Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md\">../batch17/58-df-aleph.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|:V\\to V\">\\(|\\cdot|:V\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\in V\">\\(\\aleph_0\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md\">../batch17/58-df-aleph.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}delta\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\left(|\\mathcal F|&gt;\\aleph_0\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\right)\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;\\exists C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(|\\mathcal D|&gt;\\aleph_0\\land\n\\forall F,G\\in\\mathcal D\\;(F\\neq G\\to F\\cap G=C)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}delta\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\left(|\\mathcal F|&gt;\\aleph_0\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\right)\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;\\exists C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(|\\mathcal D|&gt;\\aleph_0\\land\n\\forall F,G\\in\\mathcal D\\;(F\\neq G\\to F\\cap G=C)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A family with constant pairwise intersection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> is called a delta system or sunflower with core <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Uncountability is a separate conjunct of the antecedent. Placing it inside the bounded universal quantifier made the antecedent vacuously true for the empty family.</li>\n<li>In forcing arguments, the lemma is often applied to uncountable families of finite supports.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md","status":"resolved","id":"535817bf563314f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|\\cdot|:V\\to V$ and $\\aleph_0\\in V$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md","status":"resolved","id":"535817bf563314f5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|\\cdot|:V\\to V$ and $\\aleph_0\\in V$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"|\\cdot|:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}delta\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\left(|\\mathcal F|>\\aleph_0\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\right)\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;\\exists C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(|\\mathcal D|>\\aleph_0\\land\n\\forall F,G\\in\\mathcal D\\;(F\\neq G\\to F\\cap G=C)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false}],"bytes":1352,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3888","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-lem-delta-system.md|58-lem-delta-system]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["d9a25b0ac94a3598","2be08d4ee8aa1590","535817bf563314f5"]}